==Other Appearances==
==={{OoA|-}} (Himekawa)===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
In the {{OoA (Himekawa)}}, the animals of the forest at first order [[Impa]] and [[Link]] to go back and refuse to let them enter the wood.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= Go back. Go back. Go back.|book= OoA (Himekawa)|page= 22}}</ref> However, a Fox notices Link's pointed ears and that he is a [[Hylian]] of the old blood,<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= His ears are pointed. He's a Hylian. A Hylian of the old blood!|book= OoA (Himekawa)|page= 23}}</ref> convincing the animals to let them pass.
{{Noncanon|End}}

